# Spark Structured Streaming bookkeeping. Bakes the writer's absolute
# path (file:///Users/.../staging/...) into JSON, which breaks downstream
# `spark.read.parquet(<root>)` on any other machine. The Parquet partition
# subdirectories are portable on their own (read with PyArrow/Pandas, or
# `spark.read.parquet("data/staging/vehicle_positions/event_date=*")`).
**/_spark_metadata/
